        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ఆర్థిక",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఆర్థిక — ārthika — \"economic; financial\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "దేశం ఆర్థిక సమస్యల్లో ఉంది. dēśaṁ ārthika samasyallō undi. The country is in economic trouble."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before a noun: ఆర్థిక (ārthika) సహాయం, financial help. ఆర్థికంగా, financially."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఆర్థిక (ārthika) is borrowed from Sanskrit ārthika, \"significant; wise; rich\" (Monier-Williams), from artha, \"aim, wealth\"; Telugu uses it for money matters."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for giving reasons and opinions."
