              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ద్రవ్యోల్బణం (dravyōlbaṇaṁ) is built from Sanskrit dravya, \"substance, property\" (CDIAL 6625), and ulbaṇa, \"laid over in addition\" (Monier-Williams); the compound is a modern one."
